{"seq":1,"slug":"fault-injection-types","title":"故障注入类型分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments/fault-injection-types","wordCount":635,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"故障注入类型分类\">故障注入类型分类</h1><p>混沌工程能注入的故障远不止&quot;随机关闭服务器&quot;。系统化的故障注入分类帮助团队全面覆盖可能的故障模式，而不是只关注最显而易见的几类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>故障注入（Fault Injection）</td>\n<td>在运行系统中人为引入异常条件的技术手段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源耗尽</td>\n<td>消耗 CPU/内存/磁盘/文件描述符等计算资源至饱和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络分区</td>\n<td>模拟网络故障：延迟、丢包、带宽限制、连接中断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进程级故障</td>\n<td>Kill 进程、发送信号、注入进程级异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖故障</td>\n<td>使某个下游服务不可用或返回错误响应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"故障注入分类总览\">故障注入分类总览</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    F[故障注入类型] --&gt; INFRA[基础设施层]&#10;    F --&gt; APP[应用层]&#10;    F --&gt; NET[网络层]&#10;    F --&gt; DEP[依赖层]&#10;&#10;    INFRA --&gt; I1[CPU 压力]&#10;    INFRA --&gt; I2[内存压力/OOM]&#10;    INFRA --&gt; I3[磁盘 I/O 饱和]&#10;    INFRA --&gt; I4[节点崩溃]&#10;&#10;    APP --&gt; A1[进程 Kill]&#10;    APP --&gt; A2[Pod 随机终止]&#10;    APP --&gt; A3[应用级异常注入]&#10;&#10;    NET --&gt; N1[网络延迟]&#10;    NET --&gt; N2[丢包]&#10;    NET --&gt; N3[网络分区]&#10;    NET --&gt; N4[带宽限制]&#10;&#10;    DEP --&gt; D1[DNS 故障]&#10;    DEP --&gt; D2[HTTP 错误响应]&#10;    DEP --&gt; D3[数据库连接耗尽]\">flowchart TB\n    F[故障注入类型] --&gt; INFRA[基础设施层]\n    F --&gt; APP[应用层]\n    F --&gt; NET[网络层]\n    F --&gt; DEP[依赖层]\n\n    INFRA --&gt; I1[CPU 压力]\n    INFRA --&gt; I2[内存压力/OOM]\n    INFRA --&gt; I3[磁盘 I/O 饱和]\n    INFRA --&gt; I4[节点崩溃]\n\n    APP --&gt; A1[进程 Kill]\n    APP --&gt; A2[Pod 随机终止]\n    APP --&gt; A3[应用级异常注入]\n\n    NET --&gt; N1[网络延迟]\n    NET --&gt; N2[丢包]\n    NET --&gt; N3[网络分区]\n    NET --&gt; N4[带宽限制]\n\n    DEP --&gt; D1[DNS 故障]\n    DEP --&gt; D2[HTTP 错误响应]\n    DEP --&gt; D3[数据库连接耗尽]</pre><h2 id=\"资源耗尽故障\">资源耗尽故障</h2><p><strong>CPU 压力</strong>：验证 CPU 密集时服务降级和自动扩容是否生效</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# stress-ng 注入 CPU 压力（使用全部核心的 80%）&#10;stress-ng --cpu 4 --cpu-load 80 --timeout 60s&#10;&#10;# Kubernetes 中通过 init container 注入&#10;kubectl run cpu-stress --image=progrium/stress \\&#10;  --restart=Never -- --cpu 2 --timeout 120s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># stress-ng 注入 CPU 压力（使用全部核心的 80%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stress-ng</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cpu</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cpu-load</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 80</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --timeout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 60s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Kubernetes 中通过 init container 注入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cpu-stress</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --image=progrium/stress</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --restart=Never</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cpu</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --timeout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 120s</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>内存压力与 OOM</strong>：验证 OOM Killer 行为和内存限制配置</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 分配 1GB 内存（验证容器内存 limit 是否生效）&#10;stress-ng --vm 1 --vm-bytes 1G --timeout 60s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 分配 1GB 内存（验证容器内存 limit 是否生效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stress-ng</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --vm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --vm-bytes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 1G</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --timeout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 60s</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>磁盘 I/O 饱和</strong>：验证磁盘 I/O 对应用性能的影响</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 消耗磁盘 I/O&#10;stress-ng --io 4 --timeout 60s&#10;&#10;# 模拟磁盘满（通过 dd 快速填充）&#10;dd if=/dev/zero of=/tmp/fill bs=1M count=10000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 消耗磁盘 I/O</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stress-ng</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --io</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --timeout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 60s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 模拟磁盘满（通过 dd 快速填充）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> if=/dev/zero</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> of=/tmp/fill</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bs=1M</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> count=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"网络故障注入\">网络故障注入</h2><p>网络故障是最贴近真实事故的故障类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>故障类型</th>\n<th>tc 命令</th>\n<th>场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定延迟</td>\n<td><code>tc qdisc add dev eth0 root netem delay 200ms</code></td>\n<td>跨区延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机延迟</td>\n<td><code>tc ... delay 100ms 50ms distribution normal</code></td>\n<td>抖动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丢包</td>\n<td><code>tc ... loss 10%</code></td>\n<td>不稳定网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带宽限制</td>\n<td><code>tc qdisc add ... tbf rate 1mbit</code></td>\n<td>带宽瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络中断</td>\n<td><code>iptables -A INPUT -j DROP</code></td>\n<td>完全断网</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>恢复网络</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"tc qdisc del dev eth0 root  # 删除 tc 规则&#10;iptables -F                  # 清空 iptables 规则\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> qdisc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> del</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eth0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> root</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 删除 tc 规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iptables</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  # 清空 iptables 规则</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"进程与-pod-级别故障\">进程与 Pod 级别故障</h2><p><strong>随机 Pod 终止</strong>（Chaos Monkey 原始做法）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 随机终止 default namespace 下带 app=payment 标签的 Pod&#10;kubectl get pods -n default -l app=payment -o name | \\&#10;  shuf -n 1 | xargs kubectl delete&#10;&#10;# 模拟 OOM Kill（发送 SIGKILL）&#10;kill -9 $(pgrep payment-service)&#10;&#10;# 模拟优雅关闭（发送 SIGTERM）&#10;kill -15 $(pgrep payment-service)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 随机终止 default namespace 下带 app=payment 标签的 Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pods</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app=payment</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  shuf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xargs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> delete</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 模拟 OOM Kill（发送 SIGKILL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">kill</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pgrep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> payment-service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 模拟优雅关闭（发送 SIGTERM）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">kill</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pgrep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> payment-service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>节点不可用</strong>（验证 Pod 迁移和数据持久化）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 临时封锁节点（驱逐现有 Pod，不调度新 Pod）&#10;kubectl cordon node-1&#10;kubectl drain node-1 --ignore-daemonsets --delete-emptydir-data&#10;&#10;# 模拟节点宕机（关闭 kubelet）&#10;systemctl stop kubelet\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 临时封锁节点（驱逐现有 Pod，不调度新 Pod）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cordon</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node-1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> drain</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node-1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ignore-daemonsets</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --delete-emptydir-data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 模拟节点宕机（关闭 kubelet）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">systemctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stop</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> kubelet</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"应用层故障注入\">应用层故障注入</h2><p>直接在代码中注入异常：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Feature Flag 控制的故障注入（仅在开启时生效）&#10;func (h *PaymentHandler) Pay(ctx context.Context, req PayRequest) error {&#10;    if chaos.IsEnabled(&quot;payment-latency&quot;) {&#10;        time.Sleep(2 * time.Second) // 注入 2s 延迟&#10;    }&#10;    if chaos.IsEnabled(&quot;payment-error&quot;) {&#10;        return errors.New(&quot;chaos: 注入的支付失败&quot;) // 注入错误&#10;    }&#10;    return h.svc.Process(ctx, req)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Feature Flag 控制的故障注入（仅在开启时生效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PaymentHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Pay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PayRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chaos.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">IsEnabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"payment-latency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sleep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 注入 2s 延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chaos.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">IsEnabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"payment-error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> errors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">New</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"chaos: 注入的支付失败\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 注入错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h.svc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, req)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>HTTP 故障注入（通过 Envoy Filter）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: networking.istio.io/v1alpha3&#10;kind: VirtualService&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: payment-vs&#10;spec:&#10;  http:&#10;    - fault:&#10;        delay:&#10;          percent: 10 # 10% 请求注入延迟&#10;          fixedDelay: 5s&#10;        abort:&#10;          percent: 5 # 5% 请求返回 503&#10;          httpStatus: 503&#10;      route:&#10;        - destination:&#10;            host: payment-service\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.istio.io/v1alpha3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VirtualService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-vs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fault</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        delay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          percent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 10% 请求注入延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fixedDelay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        abort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          percent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 5% 请求返回 503</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          httpStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">503</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"依赖故障-dns-与数据库\">依赖故障：DNS 与数据库</h2><p><strong>DNS 故障</strong>：验证服务发现的容错能力</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使 DNS 查询超时（通过 iptables 丢弃 DNS 请求）&#10;iptables -A OUTPUT -p udp --dport 53 -j DROP\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使 DNS 查询超时（通过 iptables 丢弃 DNS 请求）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iptables</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -A</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> OUTPUT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> udp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dport</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 53</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -j</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> DROP</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>数据库连接耗尽</strong>：验证连接池和超时配置</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 通过占满连接池测试连接耗尽行为&#10;for i := 0; i &lt; 200; i++ {&#10;    go func() {&#10;        conn, _ := db.Acquire(ctx)&#10;        time.Sleep(60 * time.Second) // 长时间持有连接&#10;        conn.Release()&#10;    }()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通过占满连接池测试连接耗尽行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    go</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        conn, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Acquire</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sleep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 长时间持有连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"关键实践清单\">关键实践清单</h2><ul>\n<li>从网络延迟开始（影响最广泛，且易于恢复），逐步引入更激进的故障类型</li>\n<li>每种故障类型都要有对应的恢复命令，并在实验前验证恢复命令可用</li>\n<li>在非生产环境测试故障注入工具本身的安全性，再引入生产</li>\n<li>记录每种故障类型的&quot;真实等价物&quot;（如 200ms 延迟对应什么真实场景）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>故障注入从资源层（CPU/内存/磁盘）到网络层（延迟/丢包/分区），再到应用层（进程终止/错误注入）和依赖层（DNS/DB）构成完整的故障空间。系统化覆盖不同层次的故障，能发现各类隐藏的系统脆弱点。实验设计方法见<a href=\"experiment-design\">实验场景设计方法</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"故障注入类型分类","id":"故障注入类型分类"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"故障注入分类总览","id":"故障注入分类总览"},{"level":2,"text":"资源耗尽故障","id":"资源耗尽故障"},{"level":2,"text":"网络故障注入","id":"网络故障注入"},{"level":2,"text":"进程与 Pod 级别故障","id":"进程与-pod-级别故障"},{"level":2,"text":"应用层故障注入","id":"应用层故障注入"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖故障：DNS 与数据库","id":"依赖故障-dns-与数据库"},{"level":2,"text":"关键实践清单","id":"关键实践清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"混沌实验度量框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/principles/chaos-metrics"},"next":{"title":"混沌实验场景设计方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments/experiment-design"}}